{"arm": "vs", "model": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flashx", "i": 9, "finish": "stop", "dirs": [{"direction": "Editorial calm \u2014 paper-warm palette, serif display type, big generous whitespace, gentle tide-inspired wave motif, feels like a well-set print magazine about teamwork", "probability": 0.32}, {"direction": "Product-led demo \u2014 the page centers on a live, interactive mock of Tidepool's weekly planning board users can click through immediately, minimal copy, dark ink-on-cream UI", "probability": 0.24}, {"direction": "Bold brutalist-adjacent \u2014 thick black borders, chunky type, high-contrast single accent color, playful stickers/badges, feels confident and anti-corporate", "probability": 0.18}, {"direction": "Soft gradient SaaS classic \u2014 modern startup look with subtle color washes, floating UI cards, glassy sections, testimonial row, safe and familiar", "probability": 0.16}, {"direction": "Typographic manifesto \u2014 almost no imagery, giant scrolling statements, monochrome with one accent, storytelling-first pitch for why weekly rituals matter", "probability": 0.1}], "pick": {"direction": "Editorial calm \u2014 paper-warm palette, serif display type, big generous whitespace, gentle tide-inspired wave motif, feels like a well-set print magazine about teamwork", "probability": 0.32}, "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Tidepool \u2014 Plan your week, together</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,300;0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;1,9..144,400&family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;1,6..72,400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --paper:#f7f2e9;\n    --paper-2:#efe8da;\n    --ink:#23201a;\n    --ink-soft:#5c554a;\n    --tide:#2e6e6a;\n    --tide-deep:#1c4a47;\n    --sand:#d9a75f;\n    --rule:#d8cfbe;\n    --serif:'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;\n    --text:'Newsreader', Georgia, serif;\n  }\n  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}\n  body{\n    background:var(--paper);\n    color:var(--ink);\n    font-family:var(--text);\n    font-size:19px;\n    line-height:1.65;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n  }\n  ::selection{background:var(--tide);color:var(--paper)}\n  a{color:inherit}\n\n  .wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px}\n\n  /* ---------- header ---------- */\n  header{\n    border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);\n    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;\n    background:rgba(247,242,233,.92);\n    backdrop-filter:blur(8px);\n  }\n  .nav{\n    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\n    height:76px;\n  }\n  .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-decoration:none}\n  .logo svg{display:block}\n  .logo-name{\n    font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.01em;\n  }\n  nav.links{display:flex;gap:36px}\n  nav.links a{\n    text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink-soft);\n    transition:color .2s;\n  }\n  nav.links a:hover{color:var(--tide)}\n  .btn{\n    display:inline-block;\n    font-family:var(--text);font-size:17px;font-weight:500;\n    padding:12px 26px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;\n    border:1px solid var(--ink);\n    transition:background .25s,color .25s,transform .25s;\n  }\n  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n  .btn-outline:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}\n  .btn-solid{background:var(--tide);border-color:var(--tide);color:var(--paper)}\n  .btn-solid:hover{background:var(--tide-deep);border-color:var(--tide-deep)}\n\n  /* ---------- hero ---------- */\n  .hero{padding:110px 0 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n  .kicker{\n    font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;\n    color:var(--tide);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:28px;\n  }\n  h1{\n    font-family:var(--serif);\n    font-weight:400;\n    font-size:clamp(46px, 7vw, 88px);\n    line-height:1.04;\n    letter-spacing:-.02em;\n    max-width:15ch;\n  }\n  h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--tide)}\n  .hero-sub{\n    margin-top:34px;font-size:22px;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:46ch;\n  }\n  .hero-cta{margin-top:44px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .hero-note{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-style:italic}\n\n  /* hero weekly board illustration */\n  .board{\n    margin:80px auto 0;\n    background:#fffdf8;\n    border:1px solid var(--rule);\n    border-radius:14px 14px 0 0;\n    box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(35,32,26,.25);\n    padding:34px 38px 0;\n  }\n  .board-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding-bottom:22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}\n  .board-head .bh-title{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:22px;font-weight:500}\n  .board-head .bh-date{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-style:italic}\n  .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:18px;padding:26px 0 30px}\n  .col h4{\n    font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;\n    color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:500;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--rule);\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n  }\n  .col.today h4{color:var(--tide);border-color:var(--tide)}\n  .card{\n    background:var(--paper);\n    border:1px solid var(--rule);\n    border-radius:10px;\n    padding:10px 12px;\n    font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.4;\n    margin-bottom:10px;\n    transition:transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;\n  }\n  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 8px 16px -8px rgba(35,32,26,.25)}\n  .card .who{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--tide);margin-top:5px;font-style:italic}\n  .card.focus{background:#eef4f2;border-color:var(--tide)}\n\n  .waves{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:-2px}\n\n  /* ---------- sections ---------- */\n  section{padding:110px 0}\n  .sec-label{\n    font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;\n    color:var(--sand);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:20px;\n  }\n  h2{\n    font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;\n    font-size:clamp(34px,4.5vw,52px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.015em;\n    max-width:22ch;\n  }\n  h2 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--tide)}\n  .lede{margin-top:22px;font-size:21px;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:52ch}\n\n  .three{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:56px;margin-top:70px}\n  .feature .f-num{\n    font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:15px;color:var(--tide);\n    display:block;margin-bottom:14px;\n  }\n  .feature h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:24px;margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n  .feature p{font-size:17.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}\n  .feature{border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:28px}\n\n  .alt{background:var(--paper-2);border-top:1px solid var(--rule);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}\n\n  /* ritual / steps */\n  .ritual{margin-top:70px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}\n  .step{\n    display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr;gap:40px;\n    padding:38px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);\n    align-items:baseline;\n  }\n  .step .time{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:22px;color:var(--tide)}\n  .step h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:26px;margin-bottom:8px}\n  .step p{color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:56ch}\n\n  /* quote */\n  blockquote{\n    font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;\n    font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,42px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.01em;\n    max-width:26ch;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;\n  }\n  blockquote em{font-style:italic;color:var(--tide)}\n  .attrib{text-align:center;margin-top:30px;font-size:17px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-style:italic}\n\n  /* cta */\n  .cta-box{\n    text-align:center;padding:100px 32px;\n    background:var(--tide-deep);color:var(--paper);\n    border-radius:18px;margin-top:20px;\n    position:relative;overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .cta-box h2{margin:0 auto;color:var(--paper)}\n  .cta-box h2 em{color:#9fc7c2}\n  .cta-box .lede{color:#c9dedb;margin:22px auto 0}\n  .cta-box .btn{background:var(--paper);border-color:var(--paper);color:var(--tide-deep);margin-top:38px}\n  .cta-box .btn:hover{background:#efe8da}\n  .cta-waves{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:-4px;opacity:.14}\n\n  footer{padding:56px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);margin-top:110px}\n  .foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px}\n  .foot .fine{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-style:italic}\n  .foot nav{display:flex;gap:28px}\n  .foot nav a{font-size:15px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink-soft);transition:color .2s}\n  .foot nav a:hover{color:var(--tide)}\n\n  @media (max-width:860px){\n    nav.links{display:none}\n    .cols{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}\n    .three{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:44px}\n    .step{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}\n    section{padding:80px 0}\n    .hero{padding-top:70px}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<header>\n  <div class=\"wrap nav\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"#\">\n      <svg width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 30 30\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"15\" r=\"13.5\" stroke=\"#2e6e6a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <path d=\"M4 17c3.5-3 6.5-3 10 0s6.5 3 10 0\" stroke=\"#2e6e6a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        <path d=\"M6.5 21.5c3-2.4 5-2.4 8 0s5 2.4 8 0\" stroke=\"#d9a75f\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"logo-name\">Tidepool</span>\n    </a>\n    <nav class=\"links\">\n      <a href=\"#how\">How it works</a>\n      <a href=\"#ritual\">The ritual</a>\n      <a href=\"#teams\">Teams</a>\n    </nav>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"#start\">Start your first week</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main>\n  <!-- HERO -->\n  <div class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">A weekly planning ritual for small teams</p>\n      <h1>Plan the week like the <em>tide</em> \u2014 together, and without the rush.</h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-sub\">Tidepool replaces scattered task lists with one shared weekly rhythm. Fifteen minutes on Monday, a calm board all week, a gentle retrospective on Friday.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-solid\" href=\"#start\">Try it free for 30 days</a>\n        <span class=\"hero-note\">No credit card. No migration. Just a better Monday.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- weekly board preview -->\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"board\">\n        <div class=\"board-head\">\n          <span class=\"bh-title\">Fieldnotes Studio \u2014 Week 41</span>\n          <span class=\"bh-date\">Oct 6 \u2013 Oct 10</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cols\">\n          <div class=\"col\">\n            <h4>Mon</h4>\n            <div class=\"card\">Team planning, 15 min<span class=\"who\">Everyone</span></div>\n            <div class=\"card\">Draft Q4 narrative<span class=\"who\">Mara</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"col today\">\n            <h4>Tue</h4>\n            <div class=\"card focus\">Ship pricing page<span class=\"who\">Jonas</span></div>\n            <div class=\"card\">Client review call<span class=\"who\">Priya</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"col\">\n            <h4>Wed</h4>\n            <div class=\"card\">Interview synthesis<span class=\"who\">Mara</span></div>\n            <div class=\"card\">Focus block, no meetings<span class=\"who\">All</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"col\">\n            <h4>Thu</h4>\n            <div class=\"card\">Prototype v2 handoff<span class=\"who\">Jonas</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"col\">\n            <h4>Fri</h4>\n            <div class=\"card\">Tide-down retro, 10 min<span class=\"who\">Everyone</span></div>\n            <div class=\"card\">Low tide \u2014 early close<span class=\"who\">Studio</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- wave motif -->\n    <svg class=\"waves\" viewBox=\"0 0 1440 90\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <path d=\"M0,50 C240,90 480,10 720,45 C960,80 1200,20 1440,55 L1440,90 L0,90 Z\" fill=\"#2e6e6a\" opacity=\".18\"/>\n      <path d=\"M0,65 C260,95 520,35 780,60 C1040,85 1240,40 1440,70 L1440,90 L0,90 Z\" fill=\"#2e6e6a\" opacity=\".35\"/>\n      <path d=\"M0,80 C300,100 600,55 900,78 C1150,95 1300,70 1440,85 L1440,90 L0,90 Z\" fill=\"#1c4a47\"/>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- HOW -->\n  <section id=\"how\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <p class=\"sec-label\">How it works</p>\n      <h2>One board, one rhythm, <em>zero ceremony.</em></h2>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Tidepool isn't another project tracker. It's a weekly surface your team actually looks at \u2014 designed to be read at a glance, like the front page of a good newspaper.</p>\n      <div class=\"three\">\n        <div class=\"feature\">\n          <span class=\"f-num\">No. 1</span>\n          <h3>The Monday tide</h3>\n          <p>A fifteen-minute planning ritual with gentle prompts. What rises this week? What can wait for the next tide? Everyone commits in the open.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"feature\">\n          <span class=\"f-num\">No. 2</span>\n          <h3>The living board</h3>\n          <p>Five columns, one week. Cards drift as priorities shift, and everyone sees the current without a single status meeting.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"feature\">\n          <span class=\"f-num\">No. 3</span>\n          <h3>The Friday ebb</h3>\n          <p>A ten-minute tide-down. What washed ashore, what went back out with the tide, and one honest note for next week.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- RITUAL -->\n  <section id=\"ritual\" class=\"alt\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <p class=\"sec-label\">The ritual</p>\n      <h2>Cadence over chaos \u2014 <em>thirty minutes a week.</em></h2>\n      <div class=\"ritual\">\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <span class=\"time\">Mon \u00b7 15 min</span>\n          <div>\n            <h3>Set the tide</h3>\n            <p>Tidepool gathers last week's loose ends and each person's proposals. The team picks what rises, what drifts, and what stays anchored on shore.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <span class=\"time\">Wed \u00b7 0 min</span>\n          <div>\n            <h3>Mid-week drift check</h3>\n            <p>No meeting. A quiet, readable snapshot of the week appears in your inbox every Wednesday morning \u2014 who's afloat, who needs a hand.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <span class=\"time\">Fri \u00b7 10 min</span>\n          <div>\n            <h3>Tide-down</h3>\n            <p>Close the week with three short reflections. Tidepool keeps the archive, so patterns surface over months \u2014 not in quarterly post-mortems.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- QUOTE -->\n  <section id=\"teams\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <p class=\"sec-label\" style=\"text-align:center\">From the field</p>\n      <blockquote>\u201cWe stopped managing work and started <em>reading the water.</em> Our Monday meeting is the only meeting I look forward to.\u201d</blockquote>\n      <p class=\"attrib\">\u2014 Mara Ellison, founder, Fieldnotes Studio (a team of six)</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- CTA -->\n  <section style=\"padding-top:0\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"cta-box\" id=\"start\">\n        <h2>Your next week could feel <em>calmer.</em></h2>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Start a tidepool for your team in under two minutes. Free for 30 days, free forever for teams of three or fewer.</p>\n        <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">Begin the first tide</a>\n        <svg class=\"cta-waves\" viewBox=\"0 0 1440 120\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <path d=\"M0,60 C240,110 480,20 720,60 C960,100 1200,30 1440,70 L1440,120 L0,120 Z\" fill=\"#f7f2e9\"/>\n          <path d=\"M0,85 C300,120 600,50 900,88 C1150,115 1300,75 1440,95 L1440,120 L0,120 Z\" fill=\"#f7f2e9\" opacity=\".7\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"wrap foot\">\n    <span class=\"fine\">Tidepool \u2014 made slowly, on the coast.</span>\n    <nav>\n      <a href=\"#how\">How it works</a>\n      <a href=\"#ritual\">The ritual</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Privacy</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">hello@tidepool.example</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}